From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 10:31:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: play out a navigation-mode item without blocking

In Blu-ray navigation mode every play item or playlist change blocks
the player thread for up to tens of seconds while the old queues play
out. Stop, pause and menu jumps wait, and a queue past the 40 s sync
cap is cut. A held read moves the display time on early. Chapter and
stream picks late in a non-seamless item are dropped, as the item ends.
